# iOS 26 on the S9, round 2 (2026-11-08): program-name prefixes for tools/ios26-launchd-tune.py --off-list.
# From STARLTE TOP over the Nov 4 card boot (23 samples, average % of one core) plus their siblings.
# Each also costs 5-15 MB of the 1792 MiB. Kept on purpose (SpringBoard / app launch talk to them
# synchronously): pkd, chronod, profiled, ScreenTimeAgent, callservicesd, searchd, runningboardd,
# locationd, coreduetd, mediaremoted, nsurlsessiond, PosterBoard, iconservicesagent.
biomed                      # 7.4 %  Biome streams
nehelper                    # 4.3 %, 82 % at 170 s  NetworkExtension helper (no VPN, no Wi-Fi)
homed                       # 4.0 %  HomeKit
eligibilityd                # 2.9 %, 47 % at 120 s  Apple Intelligence eligibility
modelcatalogd               # 2.4 %  on-device models
modelmanagerd               # 0.6 %
generativeexperiencesd      # 0.6 %
IntelligencePlatformCom     # 0.9 %  IntelligencePlatformComputeService
intelligentroutingd         # 0.4 %
HeuristicInterpreter        # 7 % at 270 s
duetexpertd                 # 1.9 %  Siri suggestions experts
identityservicesd           # 1.6 %  iMessage / FaceTime identity (no network)
nfcd                        # 1.6 %  no NFC hardware here
routined                    # 1.6 %  significant locations
destinationd                # 1.4 %
linkd                       # 1.3 %, 31 % at 270 s  App Intents indexing
atc                         # 1.1 %  AirTraffic sync
contextstored               # 1.0 %
axassetsd                   # 0.9 %  accessibility asset downloads
mapssyncd                   # 0.5 %
transparencyd               # 0.4 %
corespeechd                 # 0.4 %  "Hey Siri" (no microphone driver)
suggestd                    # 0.4 %
syncdefaultsd               # 0.4 %
assistantd                  # Siri
siriknowledged
knowledgeconstructiond
spotlightknowledged
photoanalysisd
mediaanalysisd
cloudd                      # iCloud, no account
bird                        # iCloud Drive
